[STEVE]
Did he give you anything to go on? Clues, coordinates-
ລາວໃຫ້ເຈົ້າຫຍັງເພື່ອສືບຕໍ່ບໍ? ຂໍ້ແນະນໍາ, ການປະສານງານ -

40
00:02:45,250 --> 00:02:50,850
[TONY]
I saw this coming, few years back. Didn't wanna believe. I thought I was dreaming... 8
